# Halcyon, the Polaris demo store. Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) and fill in.
# It pays through polarispay-sdk (packages/sdk); `pnpm --filter @polaris/shop dev` builds it first.
#
# Leave everything unset in `pnpm dev` to use the built-in dev mock of the
# Polaris API: sessions, a clearly labelled test checkout, a relayer and signed
# webhooks, all served by this app under /api/dev-polaris. The mock only runs
# in a development build, never while POLARIS_API_BASE is set, and makes up its
# own random keys each time the dev server starts (it never uses the ones below).

# ── The real backend ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# `pnpm demo:local` at the repo root sets all of this for you (a local chain, the
# API, the Polaris app and this store, with fresh keys). By hand, set at least:
#   POLARIS_API_BASE=http://localhost:3100                 Polaris for Business (apps/business)
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_POLARIS_CHECKOUT_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3000   the Polaris app (apps/app), whose /pay/[id] is the checkout
# plus the keys below, from the dashboard's Developers page (or
# `pnpm --filter @polaris/business dev:merchant` for a local merchant).

# The Polaris API (Polaris for Business, apps/business, port 3100 in dev).
# POLARIS_API_BASE=http://localhost:3100

# Server only. From Polaris for Business → Developers → API keys. Never commit it.
# POLARIS_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...

# Browser-safe: identifies the store to the checkout and the relayer.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_POLARIS_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_...

# Where hosted checkout pages live: the Polaris app's /pay/[id] sheet (apps/app, port 3000 in dev).
# Session URLs must be on this origin, and postMessage results are accepted only from it.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_POLARIS_CHECKOUT_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3000

# The signing secret of the webhook endpoint you register in Polaris for Business:
#   http://localhost:3600/api/webhooks/polaris
# POLARIS_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_...

# The store's payout address on Monad: where direct wallet payments go.
# POLARIS_MERCHANT_ADDRESS=0x...
# (On Monad testnet the deployment registered one demo merchant, "Polaris Demo Studio",
# 0xA2672c1BaD9aAa4F1408929C677d58EC0E1aC185; a store of your own registers from the dashboard.)

# Optional. The relayer for gas-free direct wallet payments. Defaults to {POLARIS_API_BASE}/api/v1/relay/payments.
# POLARIS_RELAY_URL=

# Pay in 4 is always 10% APR (PolarisLoanEngine.INTEREST_RATE_BPS): $200 is 4 x $50.38,
# nothing due at checkout. POLARIS_PAY_IN_4_APR_BPS is ignored (with a warning) if set
# to anything else; there is no interest-free plan.

# The store's public URL, for success and cancel URLs. Required in production (next start);
# in development it comes from the request.
# SHOP_URL=http://localhost:3600

# Optional. Set to 1 only when a proxy in front of the store sets X-Forwarded-Host/-Proto;
# otherwise those headers are ignored, since any caller can send them.
# TRUST_PROXY=1

# Optional. Where orders are kept (default apps/shop/.data), or "memory" to keep nothing on disk.
# SHOP_DATA_DIR=
# SHOP_ORDER_STORE=memory

# ── pnpm demo:local only (development builds) ────────────────────────────────
# The local chain's contracts, as JSON (chainId, rpcUrl, stablecoin, payments,
# checkout, …), so "Pay directly with a wallet" signs for a Hardhat node.
# scripts/demo-local.mjs sets it; a production build ignores it.
# POLARIS_LOCAL_CHAIN=
